---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoDeferPanicDemo from '../demos/GoDeferPanicDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gdpd-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Interactive tracer: %w error trees, defer LIFO returns, and panic/recover boundaries" titleVi="Trình mô phỏng: Cây lỗi %w, trả về defer LIFO và biên giải cứu panic/recover">
    <GoDeferPanicDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Step through how errors.Join preserves multi-cause error trees, how defer evaluates arguments early while closures update named returns, and why every spawned goroutine needs its own recover() guard.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bấm từng bước xem errors.Join giữ cây đa lỗi ra sao, defer chụp tham số ngay tại dòng khai báo và vì sao goroutine con tự do cần recover() riêng nếu không muốn làm sập toàn server.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gdpd-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gdpd-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gdpd-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gdpd .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
  .gdpd .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gdpd .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gdpd .sd-stat b { font-size: 15px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .gdpd-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .gdpd-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gdpd-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .gdpd-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .gdpd-code { padding: 8px 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .gdpd-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gdpd-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 22px; }
  .gdpd-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .gdpd-note { padding: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gdpd-note p { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
  .gdpd-frames { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .gdpd-frame {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;
    padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
  }
  .gdpd-frame span { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gdpd-frame b { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text); }
  .gdpd-frame.is-ok { border-color: rgb(21, 128, 61); background: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gdpd-frame.is-ok { border-color: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gdpd-frame.is-bad { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-tint-bg); }
</style>
